# Everything is excluded, then the build inputs are let back in. The build
# reads Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, build.rs, src/, benches/ (declared as a
# [[bench]] target, so cargo build refuses a tree without it) and ui/.
# Nothing else: not .env files, not editor or scanner state, not the
# gitignored spec, not target/. build.rs copies ui/ minus node_modules and
# dist into $OUT_DIR and runs `npm ci` there. The re-excludes at the end
# take back what `!ui/` would otherwise let in; their order after it is
# what makes them effective, and `**/` is what makes `.env` match below
# the context root.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src/
!benches/
!ui/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
